Emerging Healthcare Trends Transforming the Life Science Reagents Market
The landscape of life science research is evolving rapidly as new technologies converge with global health priorities. Key 2025 trends include:
•	AI-driven clinical diagnostics, enhancing sensitivity and speed in disease detection
•	Personalized medicine, powered by next-generation genomic and proteomic workflows
•	Digital lab automation, improving reproducibility and data accuracy
